# Server-only GitHub token for local development.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN (NO Vite prefix) is read ONLY by the dev-server proxy in
# vite.config.js / server/githubProxy.mjs and is NEVER inlined into the
# client bundle. The browser calls our own /api/* endpoints instead.
#
# WARNING: NEVER use a VITE_-prefixed variable for secrets — Vite inlines
# every VITE_* variable into client-side JavaScript where anyone can read it.
# If you previously used VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN, rotate/revoke that token now.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
